<v SPEAKER_13>Somehow there is going to be a future beyond fossil fuel that will or, and this is of course what the American conservative sense is that you lovely people in this room here are conspiring against American power. And actually you all know perfectly well that this is the case. And when you say you want to realize the sustainable development agenda, you're actually saying, as they say in their letter to the United Nations, that you're smuggling in the geopolitics, which is fundamentally hostile to the power of the United States.

